UID:JKdaWb-XTsOApJt1xz_uL
SUMMARY:Kayaking 101: Sunset Paddle 🚣
DTSTAMP:20260706T123047Z
DTSTART:20260711T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:New to kayaking? Join us for a relaxed\, beginner-friendly intr
	o as the sun sets over the bay!🌅\n\nFrom Texas Parks and Wildlife Houston 
